  m_text: 'Goal: Toss yarn balls into the level towards the cat. Yarn balls of different
    colors can bounce off of each other. You can combine yarn balls of the same color
    to make them bigger, up to a certain point. The cat only likes yarn balls that
    have been combined. Be kind and don''t throw the yarn balls at the cat.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
